<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-archaeopteryx-lithographica-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-spatial-std-ratio-du-dv-control-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
